{"seq":37,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28408"},"reason":"New question added to grow the article from five to six facts: Which transverse arm of a church crosses the main body just before the chancel, giving the floor plan the shape of a cross? (answer: Transept), verified against the cited sources.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transept"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Peter%27s_Basilica"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Transept"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Querschiff"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"трансепт"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[1528,8],"de":[1733,10],"ru":[1573,8]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"creation","start":"1590","end":null,"precision":"year","approx":false,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"The dome over the crossing of St Peter's in Rome is completed","labelDe":"Die Kuppel über der Vierung des Petersdoms in Rom wird vollendet","labelRu":"Завершён купол над средокрестием собора Святого Петра в Риме"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transept","title":"Transept – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"227c92234f6a"},
